Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-0727057b3b2fd552END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-388776e84be4694bEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_WYR_BigBarn_DonationRecord</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_BigBarn_DonationRecord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_BigBarn_DonationRecord\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7123fb6a-e295-4c4c-a149-36e86d668232</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7123fb6a-e295-4c4c-a149-36e86d668232\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7123fb6a-e295-4c4c-a149-36e86d668232\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;62&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-110</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Flaming Fist</a>, tasked by the city's Parliament with oversight of the gathering and distribution of donations to the refugees in Rivington, responded with what appears to be a half-hearted attempt to list donations and donors. The list, much amended, possibly to conceal peculation by the Fists, includes the following entries.] \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>- <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Alyth\" title=\"Alan Alyth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Portrait_Alan_Alyth.png/25px-Portrait_Alan_Alyth.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Portrait_Alan_Alyth.png/38px-Portrait_Alan_Alyth.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Portrait_Alan_Alyth.png/50px-Portrait_Alan_Alyth.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alan Alyth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Portrait_Alan_Alyth.png/25px-Portrait_Alan_Alyth.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Portrait_Alan_Alyth.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Alyth\" title=\"Alan Alyth\">Alan Alyth</a>, nine (9) worn blankets of indifferent cleanliness \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>- <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Whitburn\" title=\"Lord Whitburn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png/38px-Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png/50px-Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lord Whitburn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Whitburn\" title=\"Lord Whitburn\">Lord Whitburn</a>, twenty-three (23) male shoes, mid-size, suitable for urban wear only \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>- <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entharl_Danthelon\" title=\"Entharl Danthelon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png/25px-Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png/38px-Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png/50px-Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entharl Danthelon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png/25px-Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entharl_Danthelon\" title=\"Entharl Danthelon\">Entharl Danthelon</a>, three (3) sets of worn travel cookware and utensils \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>- <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/38px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/50px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Figaro Pennygood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\">Figaro Pennygood</a>, six (6) muslin pillows stuffed with human/humanoid hair \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>- <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arfur_Gregorio\" title=\"Arfur Gregorio\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png/25px-Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png/38px-Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png/50px-Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arfur Gregorio\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png/25px-Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Portrait_Arfur_Gregorio.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arfur_Gregorio\" title=\"Arfur Gregorio\">Arfur Gregorio</a>, twenty-one (21) stuffed toy bears, unusually weighty \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>- <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a>, sixteen (16) books, all copies of Lord Gortash's memoirs \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>- Astele Sharpe, three jars of preserved fish, six canisters of dried beans, small crate of rothé jerky, first aid supplies, blankets, cookware - this is a jumble, I'm not sorting through all this!\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>\"Astele Sharpe\" is possibly a pseudonym of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/38px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/50px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Nine-Fingers Keene</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234315\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3411/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 53844/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 19209/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 9/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1208636/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.421      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   50.421      1 -total\n 60.54%   30.525     14 Template:Icon_text\n 51.01%   25.722     31 Template:Trim\n 31.06%   15.661      8 Template:CharLink\n 29.20%   14.725      9 Template:Icon_link\n 15.93%    8.034      2 Template:Uid\n 12.38%    6.242     14 Template:Ifempty\n 10.31%    5.200      1 Template:Main_only\n 10.26%    5.172     14 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12828-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234315 and revision id 362755. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}